  "description": "Unit 4 - Change of use of B8 warehouse to airline meal assembly facility (B2).  Relocation of 1 fire exit door and partial blocking up of 1 window opening\r\n\r\n\r\nUnit 5 - Change of use of B8 warehouse to airline meal production facility (B2) with chilled storage.  Relocation of 2 fire exit doors",
